{"seq":4,"slug":"hpc-practice","title":"高性能计算实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/hpc-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"parallel-mpi","title":"并行计算与 MPI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/hpc-practice/parallel-mpi","wordCount":2653,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"gpu-cuda-acceleration","title":"GPU 加速与 CUDA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/hpc-practice/gpu-cuda-acceleration","wordCount":2299,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"perf-analysis-optimization","title":"性能分析与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/hpc-practice/perf-analysis-optimization","wordCount":2759,"readingTime":12}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"高性能计算实践\">高性能计算实践</h1><p>本章将数值算法落地到大规模并行硬件。并行计算与 MPI 覆盖消息传递编程模型，从点对点通信到集合操作，以域分解为例展示如何将偏微分方程求解映射到分布式内存架构。GPU 加速与 CUDA 讲解 GPU 执行模型与内存层次，用矩阵乘法和有限差分模板展示数据并行的优化策略。性能分析与优化引入 Roofline 模型等分析框架，结合 VTune、Nsight 等工具链定位瓶颈。</p>\n<p>算法论文中的复杂度分析假设了理想的计算模型，但真实硬件的内存层次、通信延迟和向量宽度会让&quot;理论最优&quot;的算法在实践中表现平平。一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N \\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的 FFT 如果内存访问模式不友好，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 不够大时可能输给一个精心优化的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 直接方法。理解硬件架构的约束，是将数值算法转化为高效代码的必要条件。</p>\n<p>MPI（Message Passing Interface）是分布式内存并行的事实标准。从 <code>MPI_Init</code> 到 <code>MPI_Finalize</code>，一个 MPI 程序的生命周期围绕进程间的消息交换展开。点对点通信（<code>MPI_Send</code>/<code>MPI_Recv</code>）提供了最灵活的通信原语，集合操作（<code>MPI_Bcast</code>、<code>MPI_Reduce</code>、<code>MPI_Allreduce</code>、<code>MPI_Scatter</code>/<code>MPI_Gather</code>）则封装了常见的通信模式。域分解是 PDE 求解中最自然的并行策略：将计算网格切分给各进程，每步只在子域边界交换数据。</p>\n<p>GPU 加速为科学计算带来了数量级的性能提升。与 CPU 的&quot;少核高频率&quot;策略不同，GPU 采用&quot;多核宽 SIMT&quot;的架构，适合大规模数据并行。CUDA 编程模型将 GPU 的执行层次（grid、block、thread）和内存层次（global、shared、register）暴露给程序员，要求显式管理数据布局和线程协作。矩阵乘法、有限差分模板、稀疏矩阵-向量乘是 GPU 加速的经典案例，cuBLAS、cuFFT、cuSOLVER 等库提供了经过高度优化的基础构件。</p>\n<p>性能分析是连接算法与硬件的桥梁。Roofline 模型用运算强度（每字节内存访问对应的浮点运算次数）将性能瓶颈分为&quot;内存受限&quot;和&quot;计算受限&quot;两类，为优化方向提供了定量指引。VTune、Nsight Compute、Score-P 等工具可以深入到指令级和内核级，揭示缓存命中率、内存带宽利用率、指令吞吐量等微观指标。Amdahl 定律提醒我们：串行部分哪怕只占 1%，也会将无限并行的加速比上限锁定在 100 倍。</p>\n<p>前三章的算法知识是本章的前提——不理解求解器的计算模式就无法有效并行化。共轭梯度法的全局内积需要 Allreduce 通信，多重网格的限制/延拓操作需要进程间的网格层次映射，谱方法的 FFT 需要全局数据重排。只有将算法的通信模式与硬件的网络拓扑匹配，才能在大规模并行系统上获得理想的扩展效率。</p>\n"}